<title>USA: Hussey copper price falls to 134 cents June 20.</title>
<headline>Hussey copper price falls to 134 cents June 20.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hussey Copper Ltd said its contained copper price was down 4.00 cents a lb, to 134.00 cents effective with today's shipments.</p>
<p>((--New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
